{"id": "elections-commission-secretary-hiring-order", "title": "An elections commissioner helped set the salary for a job he sought", "seconds": 45.7, "voice": "elevenlabs:9PVP7ENhDskL0KYHAKtD", "narrator": "Jerry B.", "made": "2026-11-27", "key": "d53566966691b6ac", "words": 139, "beats": [{"scene": "p", "kind": "hook", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "In December 2014, Richard Matthews led the Elections Commission.", "t0": 0.2, "t1": 3.96, "shot": "r0", "visual": {"type": "hook", "words": ["The", "secretary", "vacancy"], "sub": "Elections Commission"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.16, 0.58, 0.86, 1.72, 2.08, 2.52, 2.72, 2.85, 3.28]}, {"scene": "p", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "He discussed raising its secretary’s starting salary.", "t0": 4.08, "t1": 6.56, "shot": "r0-more1", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "He discussed raising its secretary’s starting salary"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.13, 0.55, 0.89, 1.01, 1.62, 2.0]}, {"scene": "p", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "The highest starting step paid more than $10,000 above the bottom step each year.", "t0": 6.68, "t1": 10.94, "shot": "r1", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$10,000", "label": "Difference per year exceeded"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.14, 0.44, 0.82, 1.14, 1.37, 1.54, 1.71, 1.94, 2.36, 2.73, 3.01, 3.13, 3.43, 3.74, 3.95]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "On January 7, 2015, Matthews instructed Human Resources to post the opening for one week.", "t0": 11.16, "t1": 17.01, "shot": "r2", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "order", "kicker": "Recruitment", "text": "one week", "mark": "week"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.2, 0.72, 1.27, 1.58, 2.52, 2.96, 3.49, 3.78, 4.35, 4.46, 4.73, 4.89, 5.25, 5.44, 5.65]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "He applied the next day.", "t0": 17.13, "t1": 18.34, "shot": "r3", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "order", 